  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca8d59bc94303a4d10471bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的公主装！\r\n川上特别型态～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07cbafa0c9d3f7f7f03a966b36f8aa35caf15b839f4c2ca167ec7462df90970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988fca12993c7099f38f123b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乍看之下是学园随处可见的普通学生。\r\n但她其实是──最强的公主，川上～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62e670273c856c6e7d911a8fbe2284b0fe4ca8bcde1715c3700da67249b0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38287efd1f6df207a14562de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔来场拿着变身杖的\r\n演唱会不觉得也挺不错的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "992e3b062eb2b3ab469553ee4f14a5a25888b5bfdd316758670809917d23b1ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbe533b610bb2440f9377c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服的公主无人能敌……\r\n会展现更闪闪发亮的耀眼光辉喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2894cd1403b4af75c7ebc5024c7c267740b35aa0f2eadf1871f7f9c63e79791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d2edb2be53ba428e0b9b60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つつましく神々しく…\r\n和のプリンセス見参っ！ですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4636684d8b6059389d28e331914cb4a1e2e2b48f7bf92c675c3ece31c2ff06e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb660b6d8ab8231ee11d8fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこかに引っかけて\r\n破かないようにしませんとっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76adb72828dbad205c35097fd11c1b7f40b50dc675ca738ca946a5b295968190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6739dc7da29f7d57007227d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～啦啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aafd59703ed99cd51364ceffe116fc2e63a08d70a8de585054ba51d21bbc10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43d579eb862272895757ed6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力打飞敌人咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b1c62c308d34187507b2c4805107db45533142a429add8c06b075df2ce2799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e099b926d3ab4801badc2d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プリンセス、カジュアルフォーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd5f44903505bb8330f33dc14f9e3071ca5af0ee2dcd3deac0d8175a9fb6a6ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847097193bacc23179dc84f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫の休日は、お買い物にダンスパーティーに\r\n道場破りに大忙しですわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a0ce25b7e91257694dfe6f1f1b1471b14f0839f16ac1028cf7891aaa9592ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3bffd73f9acbb66f43bb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不负特雷森学生之名的\r\n高雅仪容对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2026db731b49339e6eb84e3af8bcd8803e1113ded03eed211c79b18f6c101603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1c0bb2251a423c341e4c81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得这套衣服很像是\r\n公主战士的演唱会服装吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd17d5f55e1deab69d19a2d1e3fa5472dc889489bad7dff7fc2f8cb0b24513ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0bbc88c05155300d0405a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的公主装！\r\n川上特别型态～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07cbafa0c9d3f7f7f03a966b36f8aa35caf15b839f4c2ca167ec7462df90970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fc376c2f893a59626734b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乍看之下是学园随处可见的普通学生。\r\n但她其实是──最强的公主，川上～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62e670273c856c6e7d911a8fbe2284b0fe4ca8bcde1715c3700da67249b0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc8c5ddbab9bca71e515e8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔来场拿着变身杖的\r\n演唱会不觉得也挺不错的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "992e3b062eb2b3ab469553ee4f14a5a25888b5bfdd316758670809917d23b1ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4b9f46210ddaad2710e1fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服的公主无人能敌……\r\n会展现更闪闪发亮的耀眼光辉喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2894cd1403b4af75c7ebc5024c7c267740b35aa0f2eadf1871f7f9c63e79791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2a0c98c916002dc9dbb45c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つつましく神々しく…\r\n和のプリンセス見参っ！ですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4636684d8b6059389d28e331914cb4a1e2e2b48f7bf92c675c3ece31c2ff06e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ba29f96d3bbcc976330df7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこかに引っかけて\r\n破かないようにしませんとっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76adb72828dbad205c35097fd11c1b7f40b50dc675ca738ca946a5b295968190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62d65c366518fc53122da11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～啦啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aafd59703ed99cd51364ceffe116fc2e63a08d70a8de585054ba51d21bbc10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852ede11ffccfcbcd1d15505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力打飞敌人咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b1c62c308d34187507b2c4805107db45533142a429add8c06b075df2ce2799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266b560a4a53dca13550e13c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f730acb13dc5c9ae2f608f77e2e8c8793a1cb90d1b908acc1ebeb904f42f21f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a6869d5fe18c7002461b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！\r\n我接受挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c0a2efcd6fdaa46cd515b1bae2cb105fdd872ad243b45c106d669d91fe8b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35e5a7912143eeb740318d1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这算什么！不管几次，\r\n公主都会重新振作～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b38843aa16bd240cd4ae869a3fd0cd7308003858c54e98419964f850073bc87f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a19a7641bf7da3432c3e2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也会像个公主\r\n打趴对手喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73cd3f4e057cd325dd92845fe5b17498357137cb8c58c34529bb1d60be4ce3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d033925ec8b9ebd42317e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快开始上课了。\r\n好好用功学习，下次一定\r\n要摆脱不及格公主的称号～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e265d195fb5b5cba7621409394c45b2facc79c0f6d57514b6388e62c479991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1b96feae2a9bb6cf8013eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好♪\r\n这是圣王亲自传授的问候方式喔！\r\n喔──呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ed0c59bd8a7fd86c38de53c35f19e7bcb6999dab876e47d6562f77083c4c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df21d704c1817d77205489bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，\r\n该喝的下午茶喝完了，\r\n下午也要好好加油咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a211e5b9f281d3a7e3e994def08228c0f4703d47f897e333ac197fe2807c2b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0a0e1326558b829338ba851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间都还这么有精神呢。\r\n真不愧是\r\n公主的训练员喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb44fef06cc9b48628c1d7925a34d4d0c016a83737a5ab2f97d5b9455c6299bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7a6b78d781d25419cfe7f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上也不能掉以轻心！\r\n因为我想让王子\r\n无时无刻都看到最棒的我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdeeda1ea412e6f81f58f340cc33fd64bf457483238ef4527339e0fb64cc13da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96b562eda42ee7419176db3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年有骨气的新生\r\n还不少呢！要不要由\r\n本公主亲自办一场欢迎会呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc932df63fb5bf9f7bf52ceb694cf09e85afff1a68dcb4e177598fc86ee60fd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2727283d6982639275c637a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灿烂的阳光♪\r\n公主的心也热血沸腾，\r\n完全不输给太阳喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b4e817cfbab5b2dcd182d9cb831ad73ccedac5c302cc09e6aff32cdd8350a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee419f2837c788dee7e5b4c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要不要也参加栗子对决？\r\n只要互丢总苞栗子就好，\r\n是很简单的游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58170d60057bbdb48d695dc01365dfaa02df8d49503fbeaaedb4a82b0e38625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e988c07a937ce03ca4fe884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉还挺冷的呢。\r\n这种时候──没错！\r\n建议要用干布摩擦身体！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89f69268dd36402414e4270fc74352b386015e3e542cec6d26dc79083d8d6fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a98c61e2f81376f611a182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1日の始まりにこのリボンを結ぶと\r\n姫ゲージがマックスになりますの！\r\nキングさんとお揃いなんですもの～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3c55f42581a515626eb1a40cec78e56a8ea606856958f4b022cd85242bf4ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a7b5cabdf7463982af48ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝のどんぶり飯だって、この衣装で\r\n食べればしっとり上品に\r\n見えると思いませんかっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57730065bce68745c0f51b4c2ce9c05aa368b4203018098443b73fd7c85d88ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61dadbe68dc3fc03d00a0cee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、おやつはいかが？\r\n実はお袖の中にこっそり忍ばせて\r\nますの！便利ですわー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "557b601634dc4203787e4ad9ecac2428d0ec68e624e47ea8c3ca8ba6bbfad56f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ec634550e20e3cb29c72b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぅん…姫…たるもの…ふわぁ。\r\nご飯のあとの眠気には\r\nふぐぐ…ま…負けませんわよ～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d421e46f699ededecd85356d69b20a13f023134309326fd25b569101ebf96649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e44373aca75d922efcfd2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このきらびやかなお衣装！これだけ\r\n神々しければ、夜でも怖いおばけは\r\n寄ってきませんわよね？ねっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9279157ba3dd215f51434cf210c4d1d99123090671efb7126517bbdfc381f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d023c9a30696ad823717ae4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このお衣装、おねむの時間に\r\n着替えるのは大変で…パールさんに\r\nいつも手伝ってもらってますの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d5befa45ef3d35b46b0fb709cb6b73ebb82981f835cf188272a60cfe28005e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bf3f07fb65d20bfc805abba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生の方々に、昔の姫君のよう\r\nって褒めてもらいましたのっ♪\r\nこの衣装で出迎えて正解でしたわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3dccd4421d09bee69cf501f00c37531eeb7d772e27e654cc7e70c2829470a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac614438f867bae32aa7896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も熱っちいですわね～。\r\nこの姿でひと差し舞ったら\r\n雨のひとつも降りますかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "145b6f5059c51f59d8a5e464df6bf675d14203f70b8112865d0fe814da520772",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83c46e01931e501dadaeb2b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "芋！栗！かぼちゃ！\r\n大地の恵みに感謝の舞を捧げてから\r\n…ガッツリ山盛りいただきますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f025a6b0edc01e7e903498393146c853655d23df2faff8d5fcf107f04dcb1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d3b603ef4853538e31b779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この季節は温かなお紅茶で…\r\n寒さなんてギッタンギッタンに\r\nのしてやりますわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2ec49f838ebb6cfec3176f60c9e7b244dfb461a59cf74acaf6b8e601d7e6292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c4867c0541560d9ba74a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90fb267b322b30d56f1526bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6649de72d36335db2cf3fac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我曾被冠上……\r\n「当心猛女」这种绰号呢。\r\n已经是很久以前的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a8944b216c056aad68e276dda4b010ff495747855b222afa6538da92f5c711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e2607f4a3c007c54bf4c6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……圣王无论是\r\n外貌还是内在都很完美，\r\n真的是一流的呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "736a6d4922b03fa0646075a74157aab2d634dd4eeb7c0a2cb86ad575a0166b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bcd0823c2e32825c4fd24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱犬赛巴斯钦\r\n也是公主的绝佳搭档！\r\n……虽然现在还很调皮有待学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1fee023ff58e2557d87826ca2902bc1534433b10c4652f06ef5b245fa7ddfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bbf01742dc3c7d9b8638eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我也拿鬼怪没辄……\r\n毕竟很可怕又摸不着，\r\n无法将它打飞啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc817c4406aff1a86fd1191a20186dc02594ea0260c7685e4dfb8919c57d202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d3081c10a13f1e98039cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤骥的三后冠\r\n非常可爱又漂亮～！\r\n很有公主的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "588d2ad5b7c9f57cce9b4aea172f64a2d0fa7b57029bd334a9e9c325e8acd750",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26881f17c5b2c37d42b21210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要在演唱会\r\n唱公主战士的主题曲？\r\n最后在背后来个爆炸特效结尾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f10c856ecb1d3a652a5007cde52b87f484de785bba2bb84b5d97bf613475e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2241422446081196d3cb0fb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和他人同台的演唱会很困难呢～\r\n我有好几次\r\n都差点踩到隔壁的脚……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aa9618abb7afc897ba9f5ecc89dfd48b4656f79c5c0bc0cd92a6488b8dc1bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b141aaf2cbc0d8bddac277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是「理想」的决胜服！\r\n是能衬托公主的服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "406159ca07a7e9594478b788fba825c8c88082551eb1dee173020f116ff58f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7b18badaa11778b98fdf5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在或许能射出公主光束喔！？\r\n要不要去外面试射看看呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f27e9de289f4ecb881be414dbafb49ebcae11205fe7426c492ddf329cd64d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbcf9279a76e4dfea4d8ef12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看看这个公主脸蛋！\r\n昨晚敷了小黄瓜，\r\n变得很有光泽♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "df4977186c5b03d1f60d36413e268ab01a0311034754403837d752c612f94279",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9401b3991e88c871e46600f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也尽情享用了午餐～！\r\n那个滋味，\r\n简直就是公主级的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b933bdc47937350015d0879234de4c255a9e19f6d0c6cea7e3fad853ce20a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011b3764269066eb9d46bc4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚要和采珠一起举办公主战士\r\n播映会！她似乎也很喜欢……\r\n守护「世界」的公主喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac470a4aac3df142e20f18291af0144e4aa40a6e856f7a2d13b60a7c684ef94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25d67a4a77f36de9ed523e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算被春风带走\r\n也请放心！\r\n我会帅气地前去相助！",
      "source_fingerprint": "512acc72b8bae8f489f582c98e103227c718c02ec7c87e4912f5550687c21205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db167f6f86e193f859fea913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了夏天就会让人回想起\r\n和昆虫【朋友】决斗……\r\n自己还是「虫公主」时的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9488b80f12bc97320014fe4bb25630b923f175eeab85df56797f85598d25ef49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ceae37c425b35d3a85aec25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烤番薯就交给本公主♪\r\n好好欣赏我为了王子\r\n磨练出来的高超技巧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f2c4556549c7d33666e8a6c5d2047089a6a96b6f089c0a8b9377dc541722d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6615e0386b35b0d93a12ffda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决定了……\r\n这个冬天要收集学园里面的雪，\r\n建一座公主的城堡！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be65a43e13f6fe90d2b984568678e4e110130c66243f0521f2bef321bbd5e6e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2259fe9c59d60cc92d3366c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、ウララさんとプリンセス流\r\n筋トレを実践中ですの！例えば\r\nバーベルの素振り…500回！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2ddddb22fafe824904cb024ff14b1c195f4edf93f5421b6de9696e6b609f9ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10bb6ed425b485b81dee087f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ツルマルさんって道案内が得意で！\r\n先日のプリファイイベントも\r\n引率してくださいましたのっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c7381b001e7c1a3b89b4d38fe1833df0560aa025b5149460c769e9fcd83947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdd9907e2f9e8a84c6782fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『硬め濃いめ多め』…テイオーさん\r\nおすすめカスタムが姫心を掴んで\r\n離しませんの…罪な味ですわ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e3ceab5c20004b894b035cc3fb71531949f6d898be3daa28e69b6fad84db29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7bb2ed64704498b24a3d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんがお茶会に誘って\r\nくれましたの。…次こそカップを\r\n破壊せずに参加してみせますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83184ccb1fcd8c7922683207606afce45df9c9e855f7a1e20ea4270619da05ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5915be7ad75dd920c571de9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんに憧れて時々髪を巻いて\r\nみるんですけど…私の直毛が強力で\r\n全然ウェーブがかかりませんの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d4b7fd07a307cb25ed94b81eabe383836b29e5127088cbb4ace81de5d6cba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c26012a5624bf6bc694e05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "モーニングティーをこぼして\r\nしまいましたの…お袖のシミ\r\n目立ちませんわよねっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6beaa1efde575ef3a8463557b3722e01aeedb778122168fe2c58f75c17d66642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e420039c421254d1a7a89eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼は優雅にランチ…人気メニュー\r\nめがけて、プリンセスダッシュ！\r\nぶちかましますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d686bdec1f4ce53c85ee99fc8132f451e201f8c5589d6e385dd8a1cf2b15b0b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb316b1461f6a58d0c38f502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日は公園でちびプリンセスたちと\r\n缶蹴りしたのでくたくたですわ～！\r\nお布団3秒でぐぅしてしまいそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3216d2b90925aac8f5daac2617aceee660c5720dca323adbc356c321a755658c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffaa3455c65bd35f62dd83b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素敵な季節ですわね～。花々に蝶が\r\nとまって…かつて虫捕り無双した\r\n日々を思い出しますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09dddbe5f26386cc166b1dabe39546feace2246f70b015d7baf3df9ae960a38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80494c72ac28456bac4ba7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウララさんと大発見しましたのっ！\r\n向かい風に向かって走れば\r\n涼しい風が2倍浴びられますのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9c6d83b2c1d433d2dd9d5ba177ad106670a503cb895dd83ee05672bc5f6542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24e92f8c6751e524878f062",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋祭りといえば初代プリファイ！\r\nうちわ争奪盆ダンスバトルは、お涙\r\nちょちょ切れの感動回でしたわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89721b9e3d45189da15f2a244029f14ee85801a04be0f002e12e92e18efba5a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c77d1e96a469af195c1fda7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒い時こそ姫の矜持が試されます！\r\n心と体を熱く燃やすため…\r\n限界筋トレ、やったりますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5121ca0b0de7e8d7964dceefb7e5f37c4c5a293b2d7e7a982abc136c3eef6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571ff1d0307d481abc65afbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私っ、ぽんぽんの強さには\r\n自信アリですわっ！プリファイの\r\nお衣装に憧れて、鍛えましたから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc01122b6467467e512238c966b6068574759f46a3e0c72b5660a2df4831138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd934e9d4dfa1ad42f2ab3e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見てください、このおリボン！！\r\nなんと、なんと、なんとっっ！！\r\nキングさんとお揃いなんですの～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14267cb7ec0696495de3cb1058b7c8a169ad5d189a26975537d9430d41cc5963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c879840d5e14694cb1842b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主之行，始于足下！\r\n一步一脚印，\r\n不断努力就能成就实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a494acd5e2afb83a287287c05d9afcd1f89194a2146f8e683c26da6ea2b092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257cbe353b4f28476d50edb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますわよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "624118d36e3f169166da3eeff290eb266924095da230646e4fd405e79b567186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96280f3607623dc3e7a4947f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好磨练\r\n自己的实力和美貌──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd613ec52a046879cb133043fd77dd1a4027f572c4d65a83e9d13ad2c5861a1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d2ec3516b2a306a8786c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始训练了！\r\nReady princess go！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f00b46d0fed9b01abc3f7a76ee7353a55d1b7acf15829c368801406e2cfcd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6806632d9e282a2e8d40fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点快点，训练员！\r\n今天也来尽情\r\n锻炼一番吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd474495771ed587c43be6d716896a8b0f7e5c09c454bdbdc81135c6bd7158b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
